    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天雨这么大，看来不能去公园了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "没关系，在家也可以动一动。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "在家怎么运动？这里又不大。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "不用很大的地方。先把桌子旁边空出来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "然后呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我们可以做一些简单的动作，再走几分钟。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "在客厅走来走去吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，听起来有点儿奇怪，但是很方便。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "邻居会不会觉得我们很奇怪？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "只要别跳得太大声就没问题。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我同意。先做多久？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "十五分钟就够了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这么短也有用吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "当然。重要的是别一直坐着。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，那我先把这边收一下。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "运动完我们再喝茶。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听起来像一个不错的下雨天计划。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，天气不好也不用整天坐着。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "file": "hsk2_sc014_word_001.m4a",
      "type": "vocabulary",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
